    "rating": 4.4,
    "about": "The W London is a luxury student housing in London Ontario. It is built for students at the University of Western Ontario and Brescia University College, with convenient access by bicycle in 10 minutes or bus in 30 minutes. A free shuttle bus is available to and from the school. The W London Ontario offers fully furnished apartments and complementary communal amenities. Browse our website for The | W London reviews and photos to get a feel for the environment.\n \nThe W London has five apartment buildings. It offers shared units, including 2B2B, 4B4B and 4B3B apartments. All suites provide in-unit washers and dryers.\nRoom Facilities in The W London Ontario:Private, ensuite bathrooms Laundry in-suiteStainless steel appliancesUpgraded soft closed cabinetsFlat screen tvBlindsIn-unit sprinklersBedroom door codesGranite countertopsDouble bedDresserDeskChairCouchOttoman\nCommunal Facilities in The W in London:Outdoor BBQ areaCoffee & vending stationsFull gym facilitiesPrivate & group study areasYoga ClassesSecure entryDining setSprinkler system\nProperty Services in W London Ontario:Utilities includedCampus shuttle (to and from Alumni Hall and The W London)Unlimited hi-speed internetBreakfast eventsMovie nightsOn-site staff\n \nThe W London is located behind the Sherwood Forest Mall, just a 5-minute walk away. It is within walking distance and biking distance to grocery stores, restaurants, shopping centers, Canada Post, banks, and Chinese Express delivery services.\n \nPublic Amenities near The W Apartments:Supermarkets: Food Basics, Sobeys Extra Oxford and Wonderland, Pistachios – Quality Meats & Groceries, and Robert & Tracey's NOFRILLS London.Restaurants: Bernie's Bar & Grill, Pizza Pizza, Ben Thanh North, Chicken Plus, Sushi Dream, Nemat's, and Rose's Tree Of Life - Caribbean Delight.Shopping malls: Sherwood Forest Mall, Cherryhill Village Mall, Wonderland Corners Business Centre, and SmartCentres London Northwest.ATMs & Banks: RBC Royal Bank ATM, TD Canada Trust Branch and ATM, easyfinancial Services, TD Canada Trust ATM, and London Currency Exchange (Inside Sherwood Forest Mall).\n \nTransportation options near The | W:Bus Stops:\nLimberlost north of Ardsley SB - #1119: 12-minute walk (Line 09)\nLimberlost at Gainsborough SB - #1125: 12-minute walk (Line 09)\nLimberlost between Lawson and Ardsley NB - #1120: 15-minute walk (Line 09)\nAldersbrook at Gainsborough NB - #126: 5-minute bike ride (Line 31) Train Station:\nLondon: 31-minute bus ride",
