  {
    "id": "62480",
    "name": "Foundry First",
    "lat": 43.010413,
    "lng": -81.200155,
    "price": 866,
    "currency": "CAD",
    "address": "625 First St, London, Ontario N5V 0B6",
    "university": "Fanshawe College",
    "distance": 0.34,
    "rating": 2,
    "about": "Foundry First is a convenient, modern student housing in London Ontario. It is the only student residence near Fanshawe College, conveniently located across the street from the school. The tenants are primarily Fanshawe College students. Foundry First London offers comprehensive amenities and first-class services, creating a conducive environment that enhances your academic achievements and social life. Browse our website for Foundry First reviews and photos to get a feel for the environment. \n \nFoundry First offers 3- to 6- bedroom apartments. It is a move-in ready property, fully furnished with all essential facilities.\nRoom Facilities in Foundry First London:Fully-equipped KitchensIn-suite StorageEnsuite Bathrooms AvailableStainless Steel AppliancesSpacious BedroomsQuartz Countertops\nCommunal Facilities in FoundryFirst:CinemaGames RoomStudy RoomsState Of The Art Fitness CentreLaundryOutdoor PatioStudent Lounge24/7 Avenue C MarketSecured Entrance\nProperty Services in First Foundry:On-site Staff & Service TeamHigh Speed InternetPremier FinishesGas IncludedWater IncludedWiFiHeating\n \nFoundry First is located at 625 First St, at the intersection of First Street and Oxford Street in London, Ontario. In addition to its proximity to Fanshawe College, Foundry First London Ontario is within walking or riding distance of banks, numerous bars, restaurants, parks, and more.\n \nPublic Amenities near Foundry Apartments:Supermarkets: Food Basics, Darryll & Tracy's NOFRILLS London, Southern Supermarket & Cafe, T & C Mart, FreshCo Trafalgar & Highbury, and Real Canadian Superstore Oxford Street - Gammage.Restaurants: Tuscanos Pizzeria & Bistro, Harvey's, Carey's Bar & Grill, barBURRITO, Hyderabadi Bawarchi, The Out Back Shack, and Oasis.Shopping malls: Northland Mall, Huron Heights Plaza, Highbury Shopping Plaza, Dundas & First Centre, The Canadian Plaza, and Kilally Shopping Centre.ATMs & Banks: RBC Royal Bank ATM, CIBC ATM, RBC Royal Bank, TD Canada Trust Branch and ATM, Scotiabank, and TD Canada Trust Branch and ATM.Parks: Mornington Park, McCormick Park, Carling Park, Kiwanis Park, Culver Park, Krupp Park, and Third Street Park.\n \nTransportation options near Foundry 1st:Bus Stops:\nFanshawe College Stop 4 - #2908: 2-minute walk (Line 95)\nFanshawe College: 2-minute walk (Line 20, 36)\nFanshawe College Stop 6 - #2226: 1-minute walk (Line 17)\nFanshawe College Parking Lot #11: 6-minute walk (Line 1, 2)Train Station:\nLondon: 30-minute bus ride",
